ne/pycryptodome/androguard,\n19\tno subprocess, <1 s per set. Prebuilt extractors must be pure python.\n20\t\n21\t## Concept table\n22\t\n23\tLegend: tool `[i]` = installed here, `[M]` = missing. \"puzzle\" = `assets/huntress_puzzle.json` (`lib.android.puzzle_candidates`).\n24\t\n25\t| # | concept | status | where the answer likely hides | recognition cues | standard tool + exact command | D16+ likelihood |\n26\t|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n27\t| 1 | Exported Activity / implicit-export default | seen D1 | puzzle; real CTFs: `onCreate` reveals the flag when started with a magic extra | `android:exported=\"true\"`, intent-filter w/o `exported` + targetSdk<31 | `aapt dump xmltree x.apk AndroidManifest.xml` [i]; `droidasc getmanifest x.apk` [i]; `lib.android.manifest_facts` | high: Mastery mixes old days |\n28\t| 2 | Exported Service / AIDL / Messenger | gap | `onBind`/`onStartCommand`/`handleMessage` compares + returns secret | `<service exported>`, `extends Binder`, `$Stub`, `IInterface`, `Messenger` | `jadx -d out x.apk` [i]; `droidasc findrefs x.apk type Landroid/os/Binder;` | med: next IPC theme |\n29\t| 3 | Broadcast receiver (exported, dynamic, ordered/sticky) | gap | `onReceive` action/extra check; action strings in dex | `<receiver exported>`, `registerReceiver`, `sendOrderedBroadcast`, custom `ACTION_*` | `aapt dump xmltree ...`; `jadx` grep `onReceive` | med-high: classic unused IPC theme |\n30\t| 4 | Content provider (SQLi, path traversal, FileProvider paths) | seen D6 | puzzle; real: `query()` / `openFile()`, `res/xml/*paths*.xml` | `<provider exported grantUriPermissions>`, `UriMatcher`, `<root-path>`, `../` | `apktool d -f -o out x.apk` [i]; `aapt dump xmltree x.apk res/xml/file_paths.xml` | med (mixed Mastery) |\n31\t| 5 | Custom permission weakness (normal level, typo, missing) | gap | manifest | `<permission protectionLevel=\"normal\">`, `android:permission` on comp vs `uses-permission` | `aapt dump permissions x.apk` [i] | med |\n32\t| 6 | Task hija