 63 (mixed-day Mastery) as seen D16. Added row 65 (JNI type/length narrowing, seen D16) and row 66 (native anti-debug/root gate, still a gap). Raised RegisterNatives to high likelihood.\n   - All 12 earlier prebuild gaps are marked built in `.run/prebuild-state.json`, so I removed them from the list and named them in a note above it. I added 10 new prebuild gaps, which keeps the queue above the minimum of 8.\n   - The five priority-1 gaps follow the native progression from day 15 (answer as a plain string) to day 16 (answer behind a gate). They cover:\n     - tracing what a native export returns\n     - working out which input passes the gate\n     - the RegisterNatives table\n     - answers assembled on the stack\n     - libraries for several CPU types, including arm64-only"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":464,"cache_read_input_tokens":79179,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":464},"output_tokens":751,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3491ccfb-4fe4-4a96-9b27-ebe49f8ca80f","uuid":"056845cb-0a31-442b-bb45-742f5d667c37","timestamp":"2026-10-16T13:19:32.091Z","request_id":"req_011Cg5yyJ66bKMwQeRLsxfda"}
